 before rebuilding its top.","Line up strip ends before comparing their lengths.","Loosen a knot instead of pulling both ends.","Mark drawers that have already been searched for a stamp.","Mark each point so a game score can be checked.","Mark shelves so they return to the correct spaces.","Practice short drum phrases before joining the pattern.","Put a gift inside before tying its box shut.","Put a picture list where younger children can see.","Read a coat name before taking a similar coat.","Read seed names before choosing what to plant.","Record who borrows each shared classroom puppet.","Replace a cracked tray that keeps leaking water.","Save a scene plan before changing its written ending.","Set out a mold before mixing material for it.","Set out painting tools before pouring the paint.","Show beat marks when teaching a remembered drum rhythm.","Split costumes between bags that can close properly.","Start timing each toy car at its start line.","Stop adding soap when there is enough for washing.","Tell a waiting friend when the meeting place moves.","Tell every helper when the shop opening time changes.","Test each carrying handle before lifting the box.","Test unfamiliar paint on a piece of spare paper.","Turn a model opening toward the person watching.","Turn a puzzle piece rather than forcing it down.","Use a funnel when filling a narrow bottle.","Use a thin brush for small painted details.","Use a thin glue line where the card pieces join.","baste","beachball","beachside","bedroom","beehives","beetroot","blade","blame","blaze","bleeds","blooms","bluebell","blueprint","boasts","boathouse","bookcase","bookshelf","bookshop","brace","brains","brave","bribe","bride","broke","brooms","class","classroom","cleans","cloaks","clone","close","clove","coasts","cookbook","crane","crate","crave","creeks","crude","daydream","drape","dreams","drone","drove","flails","flame","floats","fluke","flute","football","footprint","footstep","frame","gleams","glide","globe","grace",